---
import ArrowLink from "../ui/ArrowLink.astro";
---

<section class="relative w-full overflow-hidden bg-black text-white" id="caso-destacado">
  <div class="site-container pt-23 pb-19 max-[620px]:px-5 max-[620px]:pt-17.5 max-[620px]:pb-17">

    <header class="mb-14 grid grid-cols-[minmax(0,7fr)_minmax(320px,5fr)] items-end gap-[clamp(64px,9vw,140px)] max-[900px]:grid-cols-1 max-[900px]:gap-7.5">
      <div class="max-w-170">
        <span class="mb-2.5 block text-[11px] font-bold tracking-[0.08em] text-blue-light">
          CASO DESTACADO / 01
        </span>

        <span class="mb-5 block text-[11px] font-bold text-white">
          LUXVIAJES
        </span>

        <h2 class="text-[clamp(38px,3.8vw,58px)] font-semibold leading-[1.05] tracking-[-0.045em] text-white">
          Una operación comercial
          conectada de principio a fin.
        </h2>
      </div>

      <div class="max-w-110">
        <p class="text-[15px] leading-[1.65] text-gray-500">
          Desarrollamos e integramos diferentes componentes digitales para
          conectar la presencia web, la gestión comercial, las automatizaciones
          y los procesos internos de Luxviajes.
        </p>

        <div class="mt-6 flex flex-wrap gap-4.5">
          <span class="text-[9px] font-semibold tracking-[0.04em] text-gray-500">WEB</span>
          <span class="text-[9px] font-semibold tracking-[0.04em] text-gray-500">CRM</span>
          <span class="text-[9px] font-semibold tracking-[0.04em] text-gray-500">AUTOMATIZACIÓN</span>
          <span class="text-[9px] font-semibold tracking-[0.04em] text-gray-500">INTEGRACIONES</span>
          <span class="text-[9px] font-semibold tracking-[0.04em] text-gray-500">IA</span>
        </div>
      </div>
    </header>

    <div class="relative min-h-127.5 overflow-hidden rounded-xl border border-gray-900 bg-[radial-gradient(circle_at_60%_50%,rgba(0,80,248,0.035),transparent_32%),#0b0b0d] max-[900px]:min-h-117.5 max-[620px]:min-h-107.5">

      <div class="absolute left-[5%] top-[10%] h-[65%] w-[62%] overflow-hidden rounded-[7px] border border-gray-800 bg-black-soft shadow-[0_30px_70px_rgba(0,0,0,0.26)] max-[620px]:left-[4%] max-[620px]:top-[8%] max-[620px]:h-[52%] max-[620px]:w-[92%]">
        <span class="flex min-h-8.5 items-center border-b border-gray-900 px-3.5 text-[8px] font-bold tracking-[0.08em] text-gray-500">
          SITIO WEB
        </span>

        <div class="flex h-[calc(100%-34px)] flex-col items-center justify-center gap-2.5 bg-linear-to-br from-gray-900 to-black text-gray-500">
          <span class="text-[13px] font-semibold">AGENCIALUXVIAJES.COM</span>

          <small class="text-[10px] text-gray-600">
            Captura real del sitio web
          </small>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="absolute right-[7%] top-[31%] z-3 h-[42%] w-[38%] overflow-hidden rounded-[7px] border border-gray-800 bg-black-soft shadow-[0_30px_70px_rgba(0,0,0,0.26)] max-[620px]:right-[4%] max-[620px]:top-[48%] max-[620px]:h-[35%] max-[620px]:w-[58%]">
        <span class="flex min-h-8.5 items-center border-b border-gray-900 px-3.5 text-[8px] font-bold tracking-[0.08em] text-blue-light">
          CRM
        </span>

        <div class="flex h-[calc(100%-34px)] flex-col items-start justify-center gap-2.5 bg-linear-to-br from-gray-900 to-black p-8">
          <span class="block h-2 w-[88%] rounded bg-gray-900"></span>
          <span class="block h-2 w-[68%] rounded bg-gray-900"></span>
          <span class="block h-2 w-[45%] rounded bg-gray-900"></span>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="absolute bottom-[6%] left-[16%] z-4 h-[27%] w-[29%] overflow-hidden rounded-[7px] border border-gray-800 bg-black-soft shadow-[0_30px_70px_rgba(0,0,0,0.26)] max-[620px]:bottom-[5%] max-[620px]:left-[5%] max-[620px]:h-[26%] max-[620px]:w-[48%]">
        <span class="flex min-h-8.5 items-center border-b border-gray-900 px-3.5 text-[8px] font-bold tracking-[0.08em] text-gray-500">
          AUTOMATIZACIÓN
        </span>

        <div class="flex h-[calc(100%-34px)] items-center px-7">
          <span class="h-2.5 w-2.5 shrink-0 rounded-full bg-blue shadow-[0_0_16px_rgba(7,92,255,0.4)]"></span>
          <span class="h-px flex-1 bg-[#25304d]"></span>
          <span class="h-2.5 w-2.5 shrink-0 rounded-full bg-gray-800"></span>
        </div>
      </div>

      <svg
        class="pointer-events-none absolute inset-0 h-full w-full"
        viewBox="0 0 1200 600"
        aria-hidden="true"
      >
        <line class="stroke-blue stroke-1" x1="700" y1="325" x2="1080" y2="220" />
        <circle class="fill-blue" cx="1080" cy="220" r="4" />
      </svg>

    </div>

    <div class="mt-13 grid grid-cols-3 gap-10.5 border-t border-gray-900 pt-8 max-[900px]:grid-cols-1 max-[900px]:gap-7.5 max-[620px]:mt-11">

      <article>
        <div class="mb-4 flex items-center gap-4.5">
          <span class="text-[10px] font-bold text-blue-light">01</span>
          <h3 class="text-[11px] font-bold tracking-[0.03em] text-white">CONTEXTO</h3>
        </div>

        <p class="max-w-87.5 text-xs leading-[1.65] text-gray-500">
          Una operación comercial con múltiples canales, herramientas y
          procesos digitales que necesitan trabajar de forma coordinada.
        </p>
      </article>

      <article>
        <div class="mb-4 flex items-center gap-4.5">
          <span class="text-[10px] font-bold text-blue-light">02</span>
          <h3 class="text-[11px] font-bold tracking-[0.03em] text-white">SOLUCIÓN</h3>
        </div>

        <p class="max-w-87.5 text-xs leading-[1.65] text-gray-500">
          Integramos diferentes componentes tecnológicos para centralizar
          información, automatizar procesos y conectar puntos clave de la
          operación.
        </p>
      </article>

      <article>
        <div class="mb-4 flex items-center gap-4.5">
          <span class="text-[10px] font-bold text-blue-light">03</span>
          <h3 class="text-[11px] font-bold tracking-[0.03em] text-white">CAPACIDADES</h3>
        </div>

        <p class="max-w-87.5 text-xs leading-[1.65] text-gray-500">
          Software, CRM, automatización, integraciones e inteligencia artificial
          como partes de un mismo ecosistema.
        </p>
      </article>

    </div>

    <div class="mt-8 flex justify-end">
      <ArrowLink href="/proyectos/luxviajes" class="text-white">
        Ver caso completo
      </ArrowLink>
    </div>

  </div>
</section>
